                                                "sense_id": "61fa4f2c-00b0-3595-a895-480e13027adb",
                                                "text": "Many wheelmen and wheelwomen, riding safeties, tandems and tricycles, stopped there during the evening and we had good opportunity for comparing American and English bicycles […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01f331a4-660c-4e29-b4a2-4666fc5e5719",
                                                "sense_id": "61fa4f2c-00b0-3595-a895-480e13027adb",
                                                "text": "There are cyclists, like Mr. F. T. Bidlake, who prefer a tricycle to a safety, and to such men a long ride on a tricycle is no more fatiguing than a safety bicycle ride of the same distance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "safety",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
